{"version":1,"content":"<p>索尼日本已於10月22日結束UBP-X700/K超高清藍光播放器出貨。該機是索尼在日本銷售的最後一款獨立UHD Blu-ray播放機；索尼官方商店目前將其標為「缺貨且不再補貨」，售價為5.83萬日元（含税）。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/movie/1583434.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T18:59:37.608848+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T18:54:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T18:57:55.642616+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T18:57:55.642616+00:00","content_hash":"ca41b89b5bf10a3f9b5faa36a4595bc996d30bc3c2763d0e6cdfc4547731c6e2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}